  "cited_article_id": "configure-automated-reminders",
  "reply": "Please verify that each patient has a verified mobile number or email and that opt‑in is enabled in their profile. Then go to Settings > Communications > Reminders, edit the SMS and Email templates if needed, and ensure the dispatch window is set (24‑72 hours). Check Reports > Message Log for any ‘Failed’ entries—if failures are due to carrier blocking, confirm the phone numbers support SMS. Remember reminders are not sent for appointments marked Cancelled or Arrived. If issues persist after these checks, provide the patient IDs and timestamps so we can investigate further."
}
